Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.35,0:20:01.59,opjp2,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,120)\blur4\3c&554433&}こんなにも願ってるの
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.59,0:20:01.99,opjp2,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,0)\blur4\3c&554433&}貴方とずっとずっとずっと
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.99,0:20:05.18,opjp2,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,120)\blur4\3c&DCC566&}貴方とずっとずっとずっと
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.18,0:20:07.42,opjp2,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)\blur4\3c&DCC566&}隣にずっといたいのに
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.42,0:20:07.98,opjp2,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,0)\blur4\3c&DCC566&}こんなにも夢見てるよ
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.98,0:20:10.15,opjp2,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,120)\blur4\3c&666666&}こんなにも夢見てるよ
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.15,0:20:12.56,opjp2,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)\blur4\3c&DCC566&}こんなにも見つめてるの
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.56,0:20:17.55,opjp2,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)\blur4\3c&DCC566&}2人が離れ離れにならないように
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.55,0:20:19.89,opjp2,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)\blur4\3c&666666&}神様叶えてよ
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.70,0:19:24.52,opcn2,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)\blur4\3c&DCC566&}Yes My Love
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.01,0:19:28.93,opcn2,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)\blur4\3c&DCC566&}終於 彼此牽著手
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.14,0:19:30.49,opcn2,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,0)\blur4\3c&DCC566&}如果能和雲彩一般 緊相依不分開就好了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.49,0:19:33.79,opcn2,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,120)\blur4\3c&00CCDD&}如果能和雲彩一般 緊相依不分開就好了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.79,0:19:35.74,opcn2,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)\blur4\an3\3c&00CCDD&}Pray For You
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.96,0:19:39.90,opcn2,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)\blur4\3c&00CCDD&\an3}沿著紅線
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.08,0:19:41.74,opcn2,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,0)\blur4\an3\3c&00CCDD&}在那裡 一定是永遠繽紛的回憶
